ooltip-15","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tooltip","content":"`TooltipTrigger` wraps a focusable element and a `<Tooltip>`, handling hover/focus state and positioning automatically."},"1790":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-16","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tooltip#features","content":"`overlay` elevation panel positioned relative to its trigger, with an optional arrow"},"1791":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-17","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tooltip#features","content":"Flips and shifts to stay in the viewport"},"1792":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-18","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tooltip#features","content":"Configurable open and close delays"},"1793":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-19","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tooltip#default","content":"Use it with `TooltipTrigger`, which wraps both the tooltip content and a focusable element such as a `Button`. The tooltip appears on hover and focus."},"1794":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-20","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tooltip#custom-anchor","content":"To position a tooltip relative to a different focusable element, use the `triggerRef` prop. `TooltipTrigger` still handles showing and hiding on hover and focus."},"1795":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-21","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tooltip#customization","content":"`className` and `style` apply to the tooltip panel."},"1796":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-22","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tooltip#keyboard","content":"Key"},"1797":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-23","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":