ntrolled"],[1352,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1635,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1683,"**Controls keep the scale size.** A `Button` inside a lockup follows the surrounding\n`SizeProvider` or its own `size` prop, never the lockup's tier."],[1634,"**Controls**: A `Button slot=\"control\"` beside the input is an interactive affix; it picks up field chrome from context"],[2058,"**Custom Components:** When using `as={MyComponent}`, Box accepts that component's props. If there's a prop name conflict, Box's props take priority."],[1969,"**Custom domains**: Set explicit x and y ranges for controlled scales across multiple charts"],[1968,"**Customizable axes**: Control gridlines, tick marks, axis titles, and tick formatting"],[2030,"**Debounce resize**: The default 15ms debounce on `useParentSize` balances smoothness and performance"],[739,"**Deduplication**: Icon path data only exists once in the sprite sheet, regardless of how many times it's used"],[1966,"**Design system alignment**: 8px border radius, 12px bar width (1.5 GU), consistent spacing"],[741,"**DOM Output:**"],[1749,"**End**"],[686,"**Events**: `onClick`, `onMouseOver`, `onFocus`, etc."],[1678,"**Every part names its role with a slot**: `eyebrow`, `title`, `body`. Unslotted text follows\nthe lockup's tier too: a bare `Heading` takes the title tier and a bare `Text` the body tier."],[757,"**Fallback content**: Provide placeholder content for loading states"],[745,"**Faster Rendering**: Browser optimizations for `<use>` elements"],[730,"**First Request**: When an icon is first encountered, it triggers an asynchronous fetch from the CDN"],[679,"**Flexible sizing**: Support for `width` and `height` props"],[1355,"**Form integration**: Set `name` and the value submits as part of a native `<form>` (multiple values submit as repeated entrie